","date":"2024-08-27","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240827900215"},{"id":"D16","kind":"DART 공시","title":"자기주식취득결과보고서","date":"2024-05-03","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240503000071"},{"id":"D17","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2024-02-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240215900654"},{"id":"D18","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(자기주식취득결정)","date":"2024-01-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240130000422"},{"id":"D19","kind":"DART 공시","title":"자기주식처분결과보고서","date":"2024-01-17","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240117000148"},{"id":"D20","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(자기주식처분결정)","date":"2023-12-28","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231228000626"},{"id":"D21","kind":"DART 공시","title":"[기재정정]최대주주변경을수반하는주식담보제공계약체결","date":"2023-08-25","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230825900543"},{"id":"D22","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230215900982"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"[첨부추가]사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-20","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250320001428"}]}